# Bot1 targets Bot2's Mind Stone; in response Bot2 pays {1} and sacrifices it to draw a card. The spell's only target is
# illegal, so it does not resolve (CR 608.2b): Bot2 is never asked about a search (nor shuffles: its library is the 25-card
# deck less the opening seven, the draws of turns 2, 4 and 6 and the Mind Stone's draw) and Bot2's hand is seven cards, plus
# those four draws, less three Forests and the Mind Stone.

